msgid ""
"Qwen3.8-27B is the 27-billion-parameter dense member of the Qwen3.8 family, "
"the most capable generation in the Qwen open-model family to date. Built on "
"the architectural foundation of Qwen3.5, it shares the same hybrid-attention"
" backbone as the 2.4T MoE flagship: of its 64 layers, only 16 run full "
"(gated) attention (`full_attention_interval: 4`) while the other 48 run "
"linear attention (Gated DeltaNet) with a constant recurrent state. It ships "
"with a built-in MTP (Multi-Token Prediction) draft head and a native "
"262,144-token context window."
msgstr ""
"Qwen3.8-27B 是 Qwen3.8 系列中 270 亿参数的稠密模型，也是迄今为止 Qwen 开源模型系列中能力最强的一代。它基于 "
"Qwen3.5 的架构基础构建，与 2.4T MoE 旗舰模型共享相同的混合注意力主干：在其 64 层中，只有 16 "
"层运行完整（门控）注意力（`full_attention_interval: 4`），其余 48 层运行带有恒定循环状态的线性注意力（Gated "
"DeltaNet）。它内置 MTP（多 Token 预测）草稿头，并原生支持 262,144 Token 的上下文窗口。"

msgid ""
"Qwen3.8-27B delivers substantial gains over Qwen3.5/Qwen3.6 across coding, "
"professional work, research, and long-horizon agentic tasks. It features "
"stronger autonomous planning, more reliable end-to-end task completion, and "
"broader downstream compatibility with popular harnesses and development "
"tools."
msgstr ""
"Qwen3.8-27B 在编程、专业工作、研究以及长周期智能体任务上相较 Qwen3.5/Qwen3.6 "
"均有显著提升。它具备更强的自主规划能力、更可靠的端到端任务完成能力，并且与主流 harness 和开发工具具有更广泛的下游兼容性。"

msgid ""
